{"title": "国富论（上下册）", "index": 271, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<h1 class=\"kindle-cn-toc-title\" id=\"calibre_pb_0\">目录</h1>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0236.html#7124O0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">主编序言</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0237.html#720LA0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">原出版序及全书设计</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0238.html#72V5S0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第一篇　论劳动生产力增进的原因以及劳动产品自然而然地分配给各阶级人民的顺序</a>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0239.html#73TME0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第一章　论劳动分工</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0240.html#74S700-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第二章　论引起劳动分工的缘由</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0241.html#75QNI0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第三章　论劳动分工受市场范围的限制</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0242.html#76P840-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第四章　论货币的起源和用途</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0243.html#77NOM0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第五章　论商品的真实价格与名义价格或其劳动价格与货币价格</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0244.html#78M980-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第六章　论商品价格的组成部分</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0245.html#79KPQ0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第七章　论商品的自然价格与市场价格</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0246.html#7AJAC0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第八章　论劳动工资</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-toc-level1\">\n<a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"part0247.html#7BHQU0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">第九章　论资本利润</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-